---
# Checklist:
# - [x] Resources (requests and limits): README.md section 4 (measured); the CPU limit is the
#   ONNX Runtime thread count (`threads`), the model runs one text at a time
# - [x] 1 Replica: one model, one queue, so a question goes before every passage of every
#   deployment; a second replica halves neither (README.md section 4)

replicaCount: 1

resources:
  requests:
    cpu: 250m
    memory: 512Mi
  limits:
    cpu: '2'
    memory: 768Mi
